{"type": "say", "text": "Great, thank you all for the introductions. Let's begin the round-robin. Evan and Rina, as the Affinity Group Organizers, let's start with you two. Could you each share: (1) any practical constraints you're facing with your current separate structures — organizers, mailing lists, volunteer rosters — that we should account for; (2) your past working experiences with each other's networks or any joint initiatives; (3) any process requirements you'd like to see built into the shared governance structure; and (4) the operating commitments you're willing to make to ensure this collaboration works smoothly? Evan, would you like to go first?"}
```

